--[[
	Config/UpgradeTree: the Upgrades stall's hex tree (GDD §15.4).

	Nodes sit on an axial hex grid around the root (0, 0). A node with `requires`
	shows as "???" until that node has at least level 1. Diamond nodes cost
	costs[level + 1]; the Plot Slots node is the old cash slot upgrade (price from
	EconomyMath.slotPrice). comingSoon nodes are locked placeholders for later updates.

	Effects (per level): luck adds to the rebirth/Index luck bonus; interval
	multiplies the search interval by (1 - v x level); cash, mutation and the
	diamond effects multiply by (1 + v x level); walkSpeed adds studs/s;
	offlineCap adds seconds; offlineRate adds to the offline rate.
]]

